// Count of the winning labeled hammings strictly greater than the least.
// When none are strictly above, that count is not a kept above.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hover ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hover rank

IMPULSE hover 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hover" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
